title: Baptist Voices
description: Why the preachers who shaped Independent Fundamental Baptist churches in the twentieth century said, plainly, that they were Baptists, and glad of it: Jack Hyles, John R. Rice and Lester Roloff in their own words.
output: lessons/history/baptist-voices.html

